WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.530
Is there a shortcut for the slope of x³?

00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:06.870
Yes.

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:11.510
Bring the power down to the front, then take one off the power.

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:15.090
x³ becomes 3x².

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:21.013
At x = 2, the slope is 12.
